          give you a warning.
        </p>
        <div class="menubar-card__preview">
          <img
            src="/menubar-preview.png"
            alt="Nail Bite Beaver in the macOS menu bar"
            width="528"
            height="60"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="menubar-card">
